  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">G2Px (Digitizing Government to Person Payments) support on country implementation of social safety nets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ID4D trust fund supports countries to build out foundational digital identity systems and the G2Px trust fund window specifically supports uses cases enabling government to person payments. This is of high importance for public service delivery, social safety nets, and for the borad inclusion of marginalized groups and to ensure gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
